  "prefLabel": "Lab 703.05 Duration of Approval and Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 703.05 Duration of Approval and Review.\n\n(a) Upon its first approval, a managed care organization’s approval shall expire 3 years after initial approval.\n\n(b) Upon each subsequent review and re-approval, a managed care organization’s approval shall expire 5 years after re-approval.\n\n(c) A managed care organization that seeks re-approval shall submit a full filing, as required by Lab 703.02, 6 months prior to the expiration of its approval.\n\nSource.. #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab700.html"
}
